{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1787a9a9-3447-8c38-93eb-51a03b589e25",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:33:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Sheila Donovan. I am calling about a streetlight. It is the second time I have to call about it, so I hope you can write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll get it all down. Where's the light?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 50 Wellington Avenue. The pole is right in front, by the curb. I manage the building, so I am here every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 50 Wellington Avenue, light's out front by the curb. Is it out, or flickering, or what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neither. It is on all day and all night. Never goes off. And it is angled wrong, I think, since somebody hit the pole, or maybe it is just loose. The light shines straight into the bedroom window on the first floor. The tenant cannot sleep. She has put up a towel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that'd drive me nuts too. Light on around the clock, aimed at the window. Got it. Anything you noticed about the pole itself? Leaning, cracked, anything hanging?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] It leans a little toward the house. Not a lot. A few degrees. And the cover on the bottom, the little door, it is a bit open. So I would like a crew to check the pole, please. Not only the bulb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:32:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in for a crew to look at the pole and the fixture both. Sorry, I hear you chewing, am I catching you at lunch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:32:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A granola bar. That is lunch today. I did not have time for more, so please excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Okay, so I've got fifty Wellington Avenue, light on constantly, shining into a first-floor bedroom window, pole leaning, access cover partly open. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Exactly. And the last time I called, nobody told me anything. No call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me grab a number so someone can actually get back to you. What's the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0157. That is my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. Perfect. I'll mark it as a pole inspection so it doesn't get treated like a plain bulb change. Crews are usually through that kind of thing within a few days, and I'll note you want a call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. All right. Please make sure the note says the cover is open. Somebody could touch the wires."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, noted in bold. Anything else, Ms. Donovan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you. Enjoy your afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T14:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Go finish that granola bar."
    }
  ],
